Z||000009||Alex2004||12-27-2000||04:33 PM||||Yes, mine is an automatic. Me and dad just went to Oreily's (or however you spell it) and bought a fuse link. What i need now is the socket it's self  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ... Oh well! I'm going to check the white wire in a few and i'll tell you what happens! Well i g*2*g, TTYL...Bye<P>Alex.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:Alex917@excite.com">Alex917@excite.com</A> ||||reg||6
Z||000010||Alex2004||12-27-2000||05:16 PM||||I tapped into the white wire and it worked like i wanted it too!!!! When i turned the hazzard lights on the test light flashed but how often does anyone use hazzards anyways. It didn't flash with the turn signals, and it didn't come on with parking lights on!!!! Well that is the highlight of my day!  I just want to install it. Ok, one more question for <B>SloPonti</B>, did you run the wires up through the panels by the windsheild or though the panels by the floor and then up? Or where?!? Let me know ok, Thanks...<P>Alex...<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:Alex917@excite.com">Alex917@excite.com</A> ||||reg||10
Z||000011||StuGood||12-27-2000||09:50 PM||||Thanks for the feedback  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>FWIW, I know that I said in an earlier post that the 3rd light "should <B>not</B> flash with the hazards," but that's not a bad thing - I was just describing how the original-equipment 3rd light behaves.<P>Glad you are making progress on this - what better way to spend an icy evening  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">?<BR>With the 3rd light, and the fuse - you're putting safety first, which is the way it should be  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> !||||reg||6
Z||000012||Alex2004||12-27-2000||10:06 PM||||Well all I did tonight was go out to the garage and sit in it for a while trying to think of something to do. I cut some wire to about the lenght it's going to take for the 3rd brake light, i have about a foot extra. Then i Soldered the Fuse link on the wire. I haven't cut anything in the car yet though. So i am basicly waiting for the roads to clear up since they are icy so we can go get the 3rd brake light socket from a guy we know. So right now i'm bored out of my mind! LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Well i better go... Talk to you guys later...Bye!<P>Alex...<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:Alex917@excite.com">Alex917@excite.com</A> ||||reg||12
